A.2 Ex‑Vivo Aged Human Tissue Screen

Tissue Sources: Intestinal, bone marrow, and subcutaneous adipose tissue from surgical specimens (aged ≥65 years, with informed consent). Tissues maintained in explant culture.

Groups: As A.1, scaled to tissue mass.

Endpoints: Tissue‑resident senescent cell clearance (p16, p21 immunohistochemistry), cytokine release into culture supernatant.

Pass Condition: Consistency with organoid screen results; no tissue‑specific antagonism.

